  "why": "The glow frame on the reliquary wall walled in by a stage-7 batch: stone in front of it, under it, over it and beside it, so no standable cell the party can walk to sees its face within the entity reach, and the map the `loot` fill hangs there could never be taken. Refused as the unreachable arm. The spec named the generator's frame moved behind the reliquary wall; a probe is the primary plus a declared edit to a campaign document, so the same shape is written as a batch over the piece."
